Alright, this game got a not of negative reviews but i thought it was in the ok range.  Took me 7 hours to beat on normal, the story is lame and predictable and the gameplay is kind of repetitive.  However, this game makes you feel REALLY manly.  You punch stuff and they explode, you cut stuff in half and then they explode, you fight chaos and they eplode, basically  everything you kill explodes in someway and it feels awesome.  This makes the game fun and if you enjoy watching stuff explode under your biceps you will probably enjoy the game. There is enough killing blows and a decent variety of weapons to keep the game entertaining as you plow through it but you don;

If you are debating, play the demo, if you enjoyed it you will probablty enjoy the game, if you didn;t you probably won't  because thats kind of the whole game, except with more orks.  


TLDR; THIS GAME IS SO MANLY IT PUTS HAIR ON YOUR CHEST AND CHESTS ON YOUR HAIR
